  "description": "Typhon is a real-time, low-latency ACID database engine built on an ECS architecture with MVCC snapshot isolation, targeting microsecond-level performance. This package bundles the engine with its profiler, wire protocol, and schema-definition APIs. Pre-alpha — expect breaking changes.",
